<title>FINLAND: TABLE - ALANDSBANKEN H1 UP 40 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ALANDSBANKEN H1 UP 40 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses     38.1 vs 27.2</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses		gain 0.7 vs 0.2 charge</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations     57.7 vs 56.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  3.43 vs 2.53</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish Aland-based bank is Alandsbanken</p>
<p>Ab.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245, news@reuters.fi</p>
